WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.568
[mellow music playing]

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.017
[record scratching]

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.651
[BoJack breathing heavily] Are you close?
[Princess Carolyn] No!

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:19.953
-How about now?
-No!

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.021
Now?

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.188
You're not even inside of me.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.157
Oh, God! [straining]

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.492
Did you get there?

